00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.020
Me again. You know, you gotta set yourself
up for success, alright. And LingQ makes

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:12.090
that easier, because everything you do on
the computer is synced with your mobile

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:18.449
device, and so you can review your LingQs
on your mobile device, you can listen on

00:00:18.449 --> 00:00:22.170
your mobile device. What you should do,
you should make sure that you create

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:26.130
playlists for the lessons that you're
studying so that you can listen wherever

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:31.800
