often you listen, so that this is also

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.210
motivating that you know that you've
listened 10, 20 times so the same content,

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:40.910
still have trouble understanding it, but
it's all putting this into your mind.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:45.719
There's so many periods of so called
"dead time" during the day when you can

00:00:45.719 --> 00:00:50.340
listen, or review flashcards, or even read
your lessons on your mobile device. So

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:54.989
take advantage of all the features at
LingQ and how it works across different

00:00:54.989 --> 00:01:00.859
